Z||000010||Patrick's Dad||09-07-2001||08:28 PM||||Hmmm, I just did some Prince humor in the "What do you call your...." thread.<P>When I'm alone in the car, I've been playing him a lot. Mostly The Gold Experience ("Billy Jack B****h" rocks, and has a message to boot), The B-Sides ("How Come You Don't Call Me Anymore"), and "Come" ("Space" and "Loose"). I've been a fan since my teen years, when my mother used to come into my room and try to scream, "Do you know what he's saying?" above the music.||||reg||1
